      "tier": 1,
      "title": "高并发下 SELECT * 会让性能掉九成以上",
      "summary": "在数亿行、高并发的 PostgreSQL 上，Jake Hertz 实测 SELECT * 这类通配符查询会把性能拉低九成以上。开销来自三处：不必要的 I/O、缓冲区缓存被污染，以及多余列的序列化传输。执行时整页 8KB 会被读入内存，所有列都要过一遍 MVCC 可见性判断，再序列化送上网络；宽行让每页装下的记录更少，读放大随之加剧。结论很朴素：只取真正用到的列。",
      "url": "https://www.tigerdata.com/blog/hidden-performance-cost-wildcard-queries",
      "author": "Jake Hertz",
      "source": "TigerData 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-03-26",
      "image": "https://blog-cms.tigerdata.com/blog/content/images/2026/03/hidden-performance-cost-wildcard--queries.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "性能",
        "查询"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PG19 的 ALTER PUBLICATION 支持 EXCEPT TABLE",
      "summary": "vignesh C 的补丁在 3 月 20 日由 Amit Kapila 提交，ALTER PUBLICATION 从此可以改动排除清单，写法是 ALTER PUBLICATION p1 SET ALL TABLES EXCEPT TABLE (s1.t1, s2.t2)。给出 EXCEPT 子句会整体替换原有的排除清单，不给则清空；SET 只写一类对象时，其余未提及的标志也会被重置。排除清单里只能放根分区表或普通表，写分区子表会报错。",
      "url": "https://www.depesz.com/2026/03/26/waiting-for-postgresql-19-add-support-for-except-table-in-alter-publication/",
      "author": "Hubert 'depesz' Lubaczewski",
      "source": "depesz.com",
      "source_date": "2026-03-26",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "逻辑复制",
        "PG19"
      ],
      "position": 3
