    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Oracle 与 SQL Server 迁移工具的四个坑",
      "summary": "Deepak Mahto 列出迁移工具不会提醒的四处麻烦。不带精度的 Oracle NUMBER 被 Ora2pg、AWS SCT 等工具直接映射成 NUMERIC 或 DOUBLE PRECISION，隐式转换会拖慢过程式代码与索引；Oracle 默默完成的类型转换到 PostgreSQL 会直接报运算符错误；SCT 会把无法转换的逻辑编译成空壳过程，元数据校验看不出来；aws_oracle_ext 这类专有 schema 带来云厂商锁定，应换成原生功能或 orafce。",
      "url": "https://databaserookies.wordpress.com/2026/03/27/oracle-sql-server-to-postgresql-migration-tooling-gotchas-no-one-warns-you-about/",
      "author": "Deepak Mahto",
      "source": "Database Rookies",
      "source_date": "2026-03-26",
      "image": "https://i0.wp.com/databaserookies.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/blue-modern-simple-animated-tutorial-online-course-youtube-thumbnail13.png?fit=1200%2C675#038;ssl=1",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "迁移",
        "Oracle",
        "ora2pg"
      ],
      "position": 4
